WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
This is "Late Night"

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.003
and it's Monday.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.037
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:06.606
President Biden today
welcomed players

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:10.376
from the 2020 WNBA champions
Seattle Storm

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.211
to the White House,
but, unfortunately,

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.480
they didn't have any ideas
about Afghanistan.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.548
[ As Biden ]
Well, thought I'd ask.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.150
Thanks for coming in.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.519
The Pentagon announced yesterday
that it has asked U.S. airlines

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.888
to help with Afghanistan
evacuation efforts.

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:24.257
Okay, but remember --

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.594
they can barely evacuate people
from LaGuardia.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:28.861
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.363
Republican Congressman
Matt Gaetz

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.964
married his girlfriend
over the weekend.

00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:33.499
Apparently, it was the only way

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.201
she'd let him have
a bachelor party.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.737
[ Laughter ]
Former President Trump was booed

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.839
by his own supporters
at a rally on Saturday

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:40.906
after he encouraged them

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:43.176
to receive
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.278
They came out to see you
because they love you

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.347
and they ended up booing you.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.349
Man, you really are from Queens.

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.916
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:52.285
It's a tense --

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.153
It's a tense time in the studio.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:57.590
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.826
Former President Trump
on Saturday

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.661
criticized
President Biden's handling

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.663
of the situation in Afghanistan
and said,

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:07.066
"Vietnam looks like
a master class in strategy,

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.834
compared
to Joe Biden's catastrophe."

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:10.069
But take that
with a grain of salt

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:12.372
because Trump never went
to Vietnam

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:13.873
or class.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.508
[ Laughter ]
According to a new poll,

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.311
President Biden's approval
rating has fallen below 50%

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.079
for the first time
in his presidency

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.581
and, if his approval numbers

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.516
fall any lower,
he could start to hit

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.718
Trump's all-time highs.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:27.219
[ Laughter ]
Today is the last day

00:01:27.219 --> 00:01:29.722
of New York Governor
Andrew Cuomo's administration.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:32.091
Well, I'd say keep in touch,
but that's kinda

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.260
what got you in trouble,
in the first place.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.395
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:37.062
New York City on Saturday
held its

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:40.466
We Love NYC Homecoming Concert
in Central Park

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.101
and, to guarantee
that the concert

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:43.536
didn't become a superspreader,

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.371
they held it in a hurricane.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.040
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.108
billionaire Elon Musk
announced last week

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:52.678
that his company is releasing
a so-called Tesla Bot designed

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:55.080
to do unsafe, repetitive,
or boring tasks.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.949
Basically, it was designed

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:59.352
to hang out with Elon Musk.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.054
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

